# Material Icon Theme icons

`material.tsx` holds icons copied from Material Icon Theme.

- Source: the npm package `material-icon-theme`, version 5.39.0, files under `icons/`: `python.svg`, `console.svg`, `yaml.svg`, `toml.svg`, `json.svg`, `docker.svg`, `markdown.svg`, `diff.svg`, `document.svg`, `log.svg`, `c.svg`, `cmake.svg`, `cpp.svg`, `csharp.svg`, `css.svg`, `dart.svg`, `database.svg`, `elixir.svg`, `gemfile.svg`, `git.svg`, `go.svg`, `go-mod.svg`, `gradle.svg`, `haskell.svg`, `html.svg`, `java.svg`, `javascript.svg`, `julia.svg`, `key.svg`, `kotlin.svg`, `lock.svg`, `lua.svg`, `makefile.svg`, `nodejs.svg`, `ocaml.svg`, `perl.svg`, `php.svg`, `r.svg`, `react.svg`, `ruby.svg`, `rust.svg`, `scala.svg`, `swift.svg`, `table.svg`, `typescript.svg`, `xml.svg`, `zip.svg`, `file.svg`, `folder.svg` and `folder-open.svg`. Upstream: <https://github.com/material-extensions/vscode-material-icon-theme>.
- Changes: each icon is a React component with the paths and `viewBox` of its file. Each fill colour is replaced by a theme token, a `fill-file-*` class whose colour `web/src/ui/theme.css` sets. The transparent 24 by 24 frame that `diff.svg`, `document.svg` and `log.svg` carry is left out. `kotlin.svg` draws its path with a gradient; the path is filled with the gradient's first colour instead, and the gradient is left out. `ocaml.svg` has a first path without a fill, a point with no area; it is left out. No other path is changed.

